  m_Name: Note_FirstDiary
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::NoteData
  noteTitle: Guardian's Diary
  pages:
  - The sun has vanished. Darkness has taken over everything we once knew.
  - The creatures... they only move when the light fades. I can hear them breathing.
  - If anyone finds this, stay in the light. Or maybe... don't.
